WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:09.382
Open Users & Access -> System Update, verify Zero GitHub Login Required, and click Check GitHub Releases.

2
00:00:09.436 --> 00:00:19.195
Inspect the anonymous GitHub release notes and SHA-256 digest, then open the confirmation dialog to review rollback safeguards.

3
00:00:19.235 --> 00:00:28.078
Start the upgrade to watch live host-agent download, SHA-256 verification, sibling extraction, and health-checked cutover.

4
00:00:28.118 --> 00:00:37.419
Close the completed dialog and scroll to Offline Release .zip Upload for air-gapped portals without internet access.
